{"speciesId":295,"names":{"fr":"Brouhabam","es":"Exploud","en":"Exploud","ja":"バクオング"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"EXPLOUD triggers earthquakes with the tremors it creates by bellowing. If this POKéMON violently inhales from the ports on its body, it’s a sign that it is preparing to let loose a huge bellow."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"EXPLOUD communicates its feelings to the others by emitting whistle-like sounds from the tubes on its body. This POKéMON only raises its voice when it is in battle."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It has sound-generating organs all over its body. It communicates with others by adjusting the tone and volume of the cries it emits."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It emits a variety of sounds from the holes all over its body. Its loud cries can be heard from over six miles away."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It emits a variety of sounds from the holes all over its body. Its loud cries can be heard from over six miles away."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its roar in battle shakes the ground like a tremor--or like an earthquake has struck."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its roar in battle shakes the ground like a tremor--or like an earthquake has struck."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son hurlement s’entend à 10 km à la ronde. Ses orifices émettent toutes sortes de bruits."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son hurlement s’entend à 10 km à la ronde. Ses orifices émettent toutes sortes de bruits."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son hurlement s’entend à 10 km à la ronde. Ses orifices émettent toutes sortes de bruits."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su aullido se puede oír a 10 km. Emite todo tipo de sonidos desde los tubos de su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"バクオングの 遠ぼえは １０キロ 先まで 届く。体中の 穴から さまざまな 音を 出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Au combat, son hurlement fait trembler le sol comme un séisme."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"El bramido que emite al atacar puede sacudir la tierra con la intensidad de un terremoto."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its roar in battle shakes the ground like a tremor--or like an earthquake has struck."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"戦いのときに 出す うなり声は まるで 地震の ように 地面を グラグラと 揺らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Brouhabam peut déclencher des tremblements de terre grâce aux vibrations de son hurlement. Lorsque ce Pokémon inspire fortement, cela signifie qu’il se prépare à pousser un gigantesque rugissement."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Exploud provoca terremotos con el temblor que causa al levantar la voz. Cuando inhala aire por los tubos, hay que prestar atención, ya que está a punto de soltar un buen bramido."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Exploud triggers earthquakes with the tremors it creates by bellowing. If this Pokémon violently inhales from the ports on its body, it’s a sign that it is preparing to let loose a huge bellow."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大声の 振動で 地震を 起こす。 体の 穴から 空気を 激しく 吸い込み 始めたら 大声を 出す 前触れだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Brouhabam communique avec les autres en émettant un sifflement qui provient des tubes de son corps. Ce Pokémon n’élève la voix que pendant les combats."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Exploud expresa sus sentimientos a los otros emitiendo una especie de silbidos a través de los tubos que tiene. Este Pokémon solo levanta la voz cuando está en combate."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Exploud communicates its feelings to the others by emitting whistle-like sounds from the tubes on its body. This Pokémon only raises its voice when it is in battle."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体の 穴から 笛の ような 音を 出して 仲間に 気持ちを 伝えている。 大声は 戦う ときしか 出さないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Autrefois, l’Homme se servait du cri puissant de ce Pokémon pour communiquer d’une ville à l’autre sur de longues distances."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"En la antigüedad, los bramidos de Exploud se utilizaban como medio de comunicación entre pueblos alejados."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"In the past, people would use the loud voices of these Pokémon as a means of communication between distant cities."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"昔の 人は 遠く 離れた 街同士の 連絡方法に バクオングの 大声を 使った。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Pour communiquer avec ses semblables, il n’utilise pas que son cri puissant ; il émet aussi des sons par les trous de son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Además de sus bramidos, es capaz de emitir distintos tonos por los tubos de su cuerpo, que le permiten comunicarse con sus semejantes."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon can do more than just shout. To communicate with others of its kind, it’ll emit all sorts of sounds from the holes in its body."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"大声だけじゃない。 体の 穴から いろいろな 音色を 出し 仲間と 意思疎通を するのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":295,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[5,"level-up",29],[6,"level-up",29],[7,"level-up",29],[8,"level-up",29],[9,"level-up",29],[10,"level-up",29],[11,"level-up",29],[12,"level-up",29],[13,"level-up",29],[14,"level-up",29],[15,"level-up",29],[16,"level-up",23],[17,"level-up",23],[18,"level-up",23],[20,"level-up",23],[23,"level-up",23]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[8,"level-up",20],[9,"level-up",20],[10,"level-up",20],[11,"level-up",20],[14,"level-up",20],[15,"level-up",20],[16,"level-up",20],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"leve